      <profiles>
        <profile name="Mobile Torture Chamber" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="23b8-e2ac-5bad-ce09">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit’s Attacks step, if one or more enemy models died to a melee attack this turn, all enemy units within 12” of and visible to this unit suffer D3 Suppression. Then, choose one of the following abilities and this unit gains it until after the next time this unit is Activated:

Prolonged Suffering: While enemy units are within 12” of and visible to this unit, after time they suffer any Suppression X, they suffer Suppression X again.

Entertaining Spectacle: For each Move Roll made for your units within 12” of and visible to this unit, roll an additional D6 and discard the lowest dice for that roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
